{"words": [{"text": "قَالَ", "translation": "Will say"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "هَـٰذَا", "translation": "This"}, {"text": "يَوْمُ", "translation": "Day"}, {"text": "يَنفَعُ", "translation": "will profit"}, {"text": "ٱلصَّـٰدِقِينَ", "translation": "the truthful"}, {"text": "صِدْقُهُمْ ۚ", "translation": "their truthfulness"}, {"text": "لَهُمْ", "translation": "For them"}, {"text": "جَنَّـٰتٌۭ", "translation": "(are) Gardens"}, {"text": "تَجْرِى", "translation": "flows"}, {"text": "مِن", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "تَحْتِهَا", "translation": "underneath it"}, {"text": "ٱلْأَنْهَـٰرُ", "translation": "the rivers"}, {"text": "خَـٰلِدِينَ", "translation": "will abide"}, {"text": "فِيهَآ", "translation": "in it"}, {"text": "أَبَدًۭا ۚ", "translation": "forever"}, {"text": "رَّضِىَ", "translation": "is pleased"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "عَنْهُمْ", "translation": "with them"}, {"text": "وَرَضُوا۟", "translation": "and they are pleased"}, {"text": "عَنْهُ ۚ", "translation": "with Him"}, {"text": "ذَٰلِكَ", "translation": "That"}, {"text": "ٱلْفَوْزُ", "translation": "(is) the success"}, {"text": "ٱلْعَظِيمُ", "translation": "(the) great"}], "sahih": "Allāh will say, \"This is the Day when the truthful will benefit from their truthfulness.\" For them are gardens [in Paradise] beneath which rivers flow, wherein they will abide forever, Allāh being pleased with them, and they with Him. That is the great attainment."}